# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# packaging build artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# local run output (regenerable: kgrepair --bundle out/...)

# fetched dataset caches (regenerable: bench/build_real_slice.py)
# NOTE: written as `data/*` + per-level negations, NOT `data/`. Git does not descend
# into an excluded DIRECTORY, so a `!data/raw/...` negation under a bare `data/` rule
# is inert and the caches below would silently fail to ship.

# ...the two small third-party caches the evaluation and its tests REQUIRE:
# the offline study must repeat without the network, so these ship with the repo.
# (tests/test_derivation_eval.py asserts the P2302 cache is present and complete.)
!data/raw/constraints/
!data/raw/plausibility/


# local working notes (NOT part of the code release).

*.pdf
